//! Flappy Cat's sprites. Generated by `tools/artgen/flappy2rs.py` -- do not edit.
//!
//! Scenery, pipes, digits and the game-over banner: https://github.com/samuelcust/flappy-bird-assets
//! at `48937b0dfe094da66e38fa3bcffcbf5ad1cd5454`, halved to their native 144x256 scale. MIT License, Copyright (c) 2019
